        "subheading": "The Laguna Experience",
        "heading": "Venice Like No One Has Ever Seen It.",
        "heading_tag": "h4",
        "heading_content_width": "sm",
        "description": "<p>Far from the crowds and the familiar landmarks, Venezia Photo Laguna invites you to experience the city from the water, when its light is at its most beautiful and its atmosphere at its most peaceful.</p><p>In groups of no more than eight participants, you'll board a traditional Venetian mahogany water taxi alongside a professional photographer to explore hidden canals, quiet islands and ever-changing reflections across the lagoon. Whether at sunrise or sunset, each outing is designed to slow your pace, sharpen your eye, and reveal a side of Venice few ever witness. Back on the island of San Servolo, the experience continues with a relaxed editing session, personal feedback, and the print of one selected photograph to take home.</p>"
      }
